msgid "Objective: Apply a proved circulation-form Green special case.\n"
"\n"
"Mathematical prerequisites: Planar line integrals; double integrals; positive orientation. Earlier levels of Green’s Garden.\n"
"\n"
"Apply the established Green circulation identity for the smooth shear family F=(0,kx,0) on the positively oriented unit square. Here k=3. The theorem is a fully proved special case for this family and boundary, not a claim about arbitrary regions or fields. The earlier levels verified both sides directly for k=1.\n"
"\n"
"Exercise: prove the statement below."
msgstr ""

#: Game/Levels/GaussCitadel/L04_ApplyGaussOnACube.lean:13
msgid "Objective: Apply a proved divergence-theorem family with verified orientation.\n"
"\n"
"Mathematical prerequisites: Divergence; oriented surface flux; triple integrals; integral theorem special cases. Earlier levels of Gauss Citadel.\n"
"\n"
"Apply the proved divergence-theorem family for F=(ax,by,cz) on the outward unit cube. The specified field has coefficients 2, 3, and 4. Smoothness, the bounded solid, and six face orientations are built into this verified special case. The theorem does not assert a result for arbitrary closed surfaces.\n"
"\n"
"Exercise: prove the statement below."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `stokes_shear_patch`
#: Game/Levels/StokesSummit/L05_ApplyStokesSquarePatch.lean:13
