"\n"
"Mathematical prerequisites: Double integrals; solid bounds; density and moments. Earlier levels of Triple Integral Caverns.\n"
"\n"
"Integrate 1 over the sloping-roof solid. Its vertical section has height x. The unit y width leaves that section value unchanged, so the outer integral is ∫₀¹x dx. Prove the inner and middle formulas before evaluating the remaining one-variable integral.\n"
"\n"
"Exercise: prove the statement below."
